        "body": "AmerisourceBergen Drug obligated $6B in FY2026 to date and won 385,562 awards with an average award size of $15.5K. Obligations are down 19.9% year over year. Fiscal-year obligations rose from $2.1B in FY21 and $2B in FY22 to $4.4B in FY23, $6.1B in FY24, and $7.4B in FY25 before the current-year total of $6B."
